POW.SYSTEMS =E2=80=94 North Star

*POW.SYSTEMS is a continuously growing economic model of the physical
world: what assets exist, what they can do, what constrains them, and what
somebody can profitably or usefully do with them now.*

*Data-garden moat =3D unique transformation =C3=97 continuous collection =
=C3=97 time.*

The loop:

OBSERVE =E2=86=92 NORMALIZE =E2=86=92 TRANSFORM =E2=86=92 SNAPSHOT =E2=86=
=92 DECIDE =E2=86=92 ACT =E2=86=92 VERIFY OUTCOME
=E2=86=92 LEARN
What POW joins

*Physical objects + repair*
Track asset/model/condition/fault/component/compatibility/parts
price/broken value/working value/repair procedure/repair success/resale
liquidity. The valuable history becomes fault =E2=86=92 intervention =E2=86=
=92 outcome.

*Tradesmen + sole traders*
Join a person=E2=80=99s skills, tools, certifications, location, time and c=
apital
against local faults, installed equipment, parts, procurement, regulation,
repair demand and new technology. Core query: given this person and their
real-world capability, what useful paid physical work exists now?

*Grid + power*
Continuously preserve connections, queues, headroom, constraints,
reinforcement, electricity prices, generation, storage and project
entry/exit. Join site =C3=97 grid =C3=97 solar =C3=97 battery =C3=97 comput=
e =C3=97 equipment =C3=97
electricity price. Grid becomes the shared constraint graph underneath
physical technology.

*Compute + GPU + mining*
Treat GPUs, PCs and phones as assets with competing actions: game, mine,
rent, inference, sell, repair, reuse or idle. Do not assume a use stays
valuable; maintain enough state to react as economics change.

*Government + UK boring*
Planning, licensing, standards, grants, procurement, inspections,
certification and deadlines create obligations, budgets and physical work.
UKGraph feeds POW the changing regulatory and demand surface.

*Routing + middlemen*
POW does not need to own every service. It can route a specific
house/car/system to the right EV charger, battery, solar equipment, part,
repairer or qualified installer. Transactions generate outcomes; outcomes
improve the garden.

*House passport*
Eventually an agent can expose a machine-readable model of the user=E2=80=
=99s
electrical system, solar, battery, EV, computers/GPUs, old phones,
appliances, tools, 3D printer, robot and skills. Then ask: what should we
repair, sell, buy, reuse, install, learn to repair or put to work?

*Robots close the loop*
An agent finds a cheap broken object because POW understands fault + repair
procedure + parts + economics. A robot/3D printer can perform the
transformation. The agent acquires, repairs and resells it. POW records
prediction =E2=86=92 purchase =E2=86=92 diagnosis =E2=86=92 repair =E2=86=
=92 cost =E2=86=92 resale =E2=86=92 realised
outcome.
Unification

Breadup =E2=86=92 object / repair / resale economics
UKGraph =E2=86=92 place / work / regulation / opportunity
PowPowPow =E2=86=92 compute / mining / resource allocation
Grid =E2=86=92 energy / capacity / constraint
POW.SYSTEMS =E2=86=92 joins them

*Universal query:* Given this person, these skills, these physical assets,
this place and today=E2=80=99s constraints =E2=80=94 what useful actions ar=
e available?

The website, Muse connector, APIs, repair tools, solar router, mining
allocator and future robot businesses are harnesses over the garden.

*The garden is the asset.*

